The WCN3990 SNOC transport, wire definitions and firmware sequencing use Linux
ath10k as the protocol reference. This Rust driver is licensed GPL-2.0-only.

References:
- Linux v6.12, adc218676eef25575469234709c2d87185ca223a:
  drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/snoc.c, qmi.c, qmi_wlfw_v01.c and headers.
- ChromiumOS kernel 6.6, cc1a33bf3fcee271d9f66ccd9fbbc7b06eacdabd:
  drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath10k/{ce,htc,htt,htt_tx,htt_rx,mac,wmi,wmi-tlv}
  sources and headers, rx_desc.h, regd.c and regd_common.h.

Firmware is not included in this driver. Its source revisions, licenses and
checksums are listed in projects/aarch64-coachz-limine/wifi-firmware.json.
